    },
    {
      "id": "claim_68e6935ee36c4f31bfe45e0598b8d90e",
      "statement": "An existing worktree directory for an issue is reused rather than recreated or cleaned, specifically to preserve uncommitted agent work from a previous run; only a missing directory triggers worktree prune plus creation on branch sebastian/issue-<n> from main.",
