    {
      "id": "claim_4729e28645864198909e334c8b417274",
      "statement": "A successful job ends at a log record: ImplementSpec runs the agent for one session, then logs the worktree path, the short git status of the changes, and the agent response; the pipeline never commits, pushes, or creates pull requests, and the prompt explicitly forbids the agent from doing so.",
