    {
      "id": "claim_9c571946c20d4769b1f73cfa582d3fca",
      "statement": "The agent is the least-privileged component: ImplementationAgent roots a confined LocalShellExecutor at the issue worktree with a deny-list blocking destructive, git-write, and network commands and a ten-minute timeout, grants filesystem file access with approvals disabled, disables web search and file memory, and runs in execute mode.",
