      "statement": "Model access is resolved once per host and instantiated per run: ProviderResolver validates and selects the configured provider at construction, and each job calls CreateChatClient to build an IChatClient from an OpenAI-compatible endpoint (defaulting to https://api.openai.com/v1), which that job disposes when the run finishes.",
